    "name": "Levitate Elixirs-Spiced Cranberry Orange & Vanilla",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">INGREDIENTS: CRANBERRY JUICE,PURIFIED WATER, WHITE WINE VINEGAR, APPLE CIDER VINEGAR, RAW</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">WILLAMETTE VALLEY HONEY, BEET SUGAR, PROPRIETARY EXTRACT BLEND OF (MOTHERWORT*, GUAYUSA*,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">DAMIANA*, VANILLA, ORANGE, CANE ETHANOL*, DISTILLED WATER), CITRIC ACID, L-THEANINE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, VITAMIN C AS ASCORBIC ACID, STEVIA, SPICES, SALT, DISODIUM EDTA *=ORGANIC</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Just pour 3 oz of chilled elixir over ice, add seltzer, Garnish &amp; voila! You’re done!</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">750 ml / 25.4 fl oz</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>",
